Vendored lzop binaries
======================

The `lzop` binaries under `bin/macos/*/` are prebuilt copies taken verbatim from
the AIK-Linux / Android-Image-Kitchen distribution this repository tracks
(`bin/macos/x86_64/lzop`, `bin/macos/i386/lzop`). No Linux build ships in that
distribution; on Linux the resolver falls back to `$AIK_LZOP` and then to `lzop`
on `PATH` (for example, `apt install lzop`).

lzop is Copyright (C) 1996-2017 Markus Franz Xaver Johannes Oberhumer and the
LZO library it embeds are licensed under the GNU General Public License, version
2 or later. Run `lzop -L` on a binary to print its embedded license notice.

lzop is a distinct program from AIK itself and carries its own license; see
<https://www.oberhumer.com/opensource/lzop/> for the upstream source.
